From: eri <noreply@eri.dev>
Subject: [PATCH] eri-02 default theme

Adds the Eri Dark color theme (Anysphere-style flat #181818 chrome with
blue #228df2 accent and white #d6d6dd active-tab top border), registers
it as a contribution in the theme-defaults extension, and promotes it to
the OOTB default by repointing ThemeSettingDefaults.COLOR_THEME_DARK at
"Eri Dark".

Covers RESKIN_PUNCH_LIST.md §1.

---
 extensions/theme-defaults/package.json             |   6 +
 extensions/theme-defaults/package.nls.json         |   1 +
 .../themes/eri-dark-color-theme.json               | 142 +++++++++++++++++++++
 .../themes/common/workbenchThemeService.ts         |   2 +-
 4 files changed, 150 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 extensions/theme-defaults/themes/eri-dark-color-theme.json

diff --git a/extensions/theme-defaults/package.json b/extensions/theme-defaults/package.json
--- a/extensions/theme-defaults/package.json
+++ b/extensions/theme-defaults/package.json
@@ -13,6 +13,12 @@
   },
   "contributes": {
     "themes": [
+      {
+        "id": "Eri Dark",
+        "label": "%eriDarkThemeLabel%",
+        "uiTheme": "vs-dark",
+        "path": "./themes/eri-dark-color-theme.json"
+      },
       {
         "id": "Light 2026",
         "label": "%light2026ThemeLabel%",
diff --git a/extensions/theme-defaults/package.nls.json b/extensions/theme-defaults/package.nls.json
--- a/extensions/theme-defaults/package.nls.json
+++ b/extensions/theme-defaults/package.nls.json
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 {
 	"displayName": "Default Themes",
 	"description": "The default Visual Studio light and dark themes",
+	"eriDarkThemeLabel": "Eri Dark",
 	"light2026ThemeLabel": "Light 2026",
 	"dark2026ThemeLabel": "Dark 2026",
 	"darkPlusColorThemeLabel": "Dark+",
